rewritten-to-match
Same generator, same Jaro algorithm line by line (window, match flags, transposition count, the three-term mean). The reference's Vec<(String, String)> is a byte array with an offset and length per string, and its per-call boolean vectors are two state arrays cleared with fill. The window loop skips a start beyond the end by the empty range. Other stores are checked and undo-logged. Scratch state rebuilt every run (the reference's locals: flags1, flags2) is declared `unlogged`, kept out of the undo log.
